| As EABIExit, but exits with both threads still running (not joined).
| Logs to <Wimp$ScrapDir>.EABIExit whether ARMEABISupport still finds this
| program at each stage up to its exit (PASS/FAIL), then shows that file.
| Afterwards *ARMEABISupport_Info should list no App left by it.
Set UST$Dir <Obey$Dir>
WimpSlot -min 8000K
Run <UST$Dir>.eabxtest -nojoin
Type <Wimp$ScrapDir>.EABIExit
